{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a small slime on an epic journey through the Tower of Slimes. Immerse yourself in a world filled with diverse slimes and unique environments. With no prior knowledge, let the tower's caretaker guide you as you discover who you are and why you were created. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/e0392965afef5111b85da2788a2d8908.poster.avif?t=1771017902\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/e0392965afef5111b85da2788a2d8908.webm?t=1771017902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/e0392965afef5111b85da2788a2d8908.mp4?t=1771017902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/b5fd2efebfbc4fa2aef3f97bd22380a9.avif?t=1771017902\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a universe rich in interactions and stories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/f9ee8667c29e6c8e46fb20262969e122.poster.avif?t=1771017902\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/f9ee8667c29e6c8e46fb20262969e122.webm?t=1771017902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/f9ee8667c29e6c8e46fb20262969e122.mp4?t=1771017902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/d7569f9ba7a60d737a95a6a4c07a2c45.avif?t=1771017902\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, learn new abilities: shoot fireballs, stick to walls, and master the powers of the elements scattered throughout the tower \u2014 fire, ice, earth, plant, lightning, and poison \u2014 each with its own unique characteristics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/35be77e1b9c5b9f0573fe36a4a5ccbbe.poster.avif?t=1771017902\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/35be77e1b9c5b9f0573fe36a4a5ccbbe.webm?t=1771017902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/35be77e1b9c5b9f0573fe36a4a5ccbbe.mp4?t=1771017902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own story with meaningful choices, conversing with NPCs of each element. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/9390fc4edd8ccc70e0813ca24450f347.poster.avif?t=1771017902\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/9390fc4edd8ccc70e0813ca24450f347.webm?t=1771017902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/9390fc4edd8ccc70e0813ca24450f347.mp4?t=1771017902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/b8849d5d430d3fa0f79a401adc32a515.avif?t=1771017902\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your adaptive abilities, face challenging bosses and various enemies. Survive battles, grow stronger, and unveil the secrets of this fascinating world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/b143eb330c8c67c43bd08b128728ad5f.poster.avif?t=1771017902\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/b143eb330c8c67c43bd08b128728ad5f.webm?t=1771017902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/b143eb330c8c67c43bd08b128728ad5f.mp4?t=1771017902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3143310?t=1771017902","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3143310?t=1771017902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/3f502188c7bc8ef1aa5d55defa01c6e49e4b55c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771017902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/3f502188c7bc8ef1aa5d55defa01c6e49e4b55c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771017902","categories":[{